  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fortalecimiento Ensenanza Tcnica</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Education Strengthening</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OBJECTIVE: THE TRANSFORMATION OF THE TECHNICAL EDUCATION SYSTEM LINKING MANPOWER SUPPLY WITH THE DEMAND FOR TECHNICIANS BY THE PRIVATE SECTOR. COMPONENTS: I) INSTITUTIONAL STREAMLINING OF CETP, WITH PRIVATE SECTOR PARTICIPATION, DESIGN OF DESCENTRALISED FINANCIAL MANAGEMENT MODEL AND CONSOLIDATION OF CURRICULUM STUDIES AND SCHOOLS; (II) CURRICULUM DESIGN, TRAINING FOR TEACHERS  ACADEMIC MATERIAL AND III) INFRASTRUCTURE REMODELING AND CONSTRUCTION.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
